@anon.984efe779a4077b66be6415f964eeb42.2227 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [562 x i8] }> <{ [562 x i8] c"The root element of a document and its metadata.\0A\0AAll documents are automatically wrapped in a `document` element. You cannot\0Acreate a document element yourself. This function is only used with\0A[set rules]($styling/#set-rules) to specify document metadata. Such a set\0Arule must appear before any of the document's contents.\0A\0A```example\0A#set document(title: [Hello])\0A\0AThis has no visible output, but\0Aembeds metadata into the PDF!\0A```\0A\0ANote that metadata set with this function is not rendered within the\0Adocument. Instead, it is embedded in the compiled PDF file." }>, align 1
